Package: paradoxR
Title: Drop-in Colour Palettes and Scales for 'ggplot2'
Version: 26.11.0
Authors@R: 
    person("catch-26", email = "59668327+catch-26@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides drop-in replacements for the default colour scales of
    'ggplot2'. The sienna palette family covers discrete, continuous, binned
    and diverging scales, a global switch for every plot, and helpers for
    gradients and single-hue ramps.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/catch-26/paradoxR
BugReports: https://github.com/catch-26/paradoxR/issues
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: 
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    grDevices,
    rlang (>= 1.0.0),
    scales (>= 1.3.0)
Suggests: 
    colorspace,
    methods,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
